{"version":1,"content":"<p>據韓國媒體The Elec援引業內人士消息報道，蘋果正在考慮推遲或取消其計劃中的OLED屏iMac。由於OLED面板成本高昂，以及市場對OLED設備的需求低於預期，蘋果正在與三星顯示（Samsung Display）討論調整OLED iMac的開發時間表。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587128.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.576882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:19:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.032232+00:00","content_hash":"776f936b33fdd1922c32fcd2230538f2aad3a76aa9df94a4c1557194eaada484","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}